WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.500
The Strongest Group of Knights!

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.500
The Royal Knights Assemble!

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:07.560
The Strongest Group of Knights!

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.500
The Royal Knights Assemble!

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:15.580
The fight with Belphemon completely destroyed the dimensional barrier.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:20.080
Unless something was done, both the Digital World and the human world would be destroyed.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:24.890
Just then, BanchouLeomon appeared on top of Mount Fuji.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:30.140
BanchouLeomon is risking his life to support the Digital World!

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:33.820
We've got to show the same amount of guts that he's shown!

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:38.170
Let's go, Masaru!

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:39.320
To the Digital World!

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:43.510
Masaru-niichan!

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:44.460
Can you hear me?

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:45.040
Chika!

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:47.130
I see... okay.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:49.110
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:53.360
Try to make it back by dinner-time.

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:56.430
I'll be waiting with a heaping plate of fried eggs.

00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:58.340
Okay.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.520
We'll be sure to come back home.

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:07.140
Let's go, ShineGreymon!

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:08.280
Okay!

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:17.820
They're our only hope left.

00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:20.290
We're counting on you, Masaru.

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:25.440
I see it, Aniki.

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:25.940
All right!

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:27.160
Plunge right in!

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:34.460
There's air turbulence!

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:35.400
Be careful!

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:37.740
Yoshino!

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:38.780
Yoshino-san!

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:40.690
Ravemon, hurry!

00:01:40.690 --> 00:01:41.580
Okay!

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:42.760
Yoshino!

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:52.630
Yoshino!

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:53.530
Thank goodness!

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:55.180
You're safe!

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:56.880
La... Lalamon?

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:00.270
Come on!

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:02.410
Hurry up and dig me out!

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:07.210
Thanks for helping me.

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:08.950
It looks like everyone else is okay, too.

00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:10.200
Oww...

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:12.630
Aniki, I can't eat anymore.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:15.420
So, anyway...

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:17.790
What is this place?

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:19.200
Where are we?

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:20.380
Look up, Masaru.

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:22.810
You can see Earth in the sky.

00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:25.080
That proves we're in the Digital World.

00:02:27.430 --> 00:02:28.850
Well, here we are.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:33.720
What's wrong, Yoshino?

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.560
Th-This rock moved!

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:36.860
It even talked!

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:39.230
It might be a Digimon.

00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:40.620
Let's dig 'im out.

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:45.330
Ah, thank you for helping me!

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:56.050
Gotsumon...

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:56.050
Gotsumon...

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:00.970
Well, I am Gotsumon, but is there a problem?

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.780
Damn it, you were alive?!

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:05.470
Wait.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:08.200
He may look the same, but it's possible he's completely different now.

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:09.950
Completely different?

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:09.950
Completely different?

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:11.270
It seems...

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:15.530
It seems as if you are all angry at me, but that must be my imagination, right?

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:17.500
I haven't done anything wrong.

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:19.590
He's the same.

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:20.500
Definitely the same.

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:25.580
Even so, Gotsumon was turned into a Digiegg and was reborn.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.720
He shouldn't be able to remember us now.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.020
I'm so grateful that you've helped me!

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:32.300
You've saved my life!

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:33.040
Thank you!

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:34.740
Thank you very much!

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:38.830
His personality does appear to have changed...

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:42.340
But when he acts like that, it actually makes it harder to trust him...

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:43.710
Anyway...

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:46.020
Why were you buried in this beach?

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:47.120
I was hoping...

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:49.030
I was hoping you'd ask!

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:52.850
I felt strangely uneasy about something this morning,

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.620
so I came here to check out the scenery.

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:58.250
What is that?!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.450
Something is falli-!

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.370
And that's what happened.

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:08.990
I see...

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.720
Well, that's harsh.

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:12.130
It's a good thing you weren't injured.

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:13.580
You've got that right!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:16.850
That large Digimon who fell out of the sky was most likely...

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:18.050
ShineGreymon.

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:19.070
Yup.

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:20.700
Let's just leave the ignorant to their laughing.

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:22.100
Anyway, Aniki!

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:24.140
We need to find Ykkrajil quick!

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:25.100
Oh yeah.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.260
It's Yggdrasil.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:31.520
I've heard of Yggdrasil, but...

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:33.470
We don't know where he is.

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:34.410
I see.

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:36.580
How do we go about finding him?

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:38.400
I know where he is.

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:43.590
Yggdrasil is our God who controls everything in the Digital World.

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:46.440
If you'd like to meet him, I shall take you to him.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:52.000
It's a trap. It has to be!

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.410
Master, this smells dangerous.

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.720
He certainly isn't the most trustworthy guy I know.

00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:58.820
I think it's okay to trust him.

00:05:58.820 --> 00:05:59.560
Ikuto!

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.900
Gotsumon is reborn.

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:03.750
He doesn't even remember me.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:04.980
He's different from before.

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:07.240
I'll trust him, too.

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:08.040
Why?

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:09.370
 C'mon, remember that old saying?

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:11.740
"If you don't go in the butt, you won't get the tiger cub."

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:17.910
NOTE: Masaru meant to say "If you do not enter the tiger's den, you will not catch its cub," which means "Nothing ventured, nothing gained."

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:16.140
It's not "the butt."

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.420
It's "the tiger's den."

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.540
Is this the only path we can take?

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:26.600
Don't you think it'll be faster if we evolved?

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:27.880
No, take a look.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:31.420
The skies have greater air turbulence than what we experienced earlier.

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:32.850
It's dangerous to fly here.

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:52.360
The Government Declares a State of Emergency

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:51.400
I repeat, the government has declared a state of emergency.

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:55.570
We ask that the public please follow police instructions and act calmly when seeking refuge.

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:55.440
Hey, Mom.

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:56.830
Shouldn't we evacuate?

00:06:55.570 --> 00:07:00.460
I repeat, we ask that the public please follow police instructions and act calmly when seeking refuge.

00:06:57.570 --> 00:06:58.850
Why?

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:01.310
Because we're the only ones who are staying behind.

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:05.540
It'll be the same no matter where we run.

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:07.770
Besides...

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:12.470
Masaru and the others will be sad if they don't find us here when they come back.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:15.960
That's true.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:19.780
I'm kind of hungry now!

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:23.650
Dearest...

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:28.030
If something dangerous ever happened to Masaru...

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:30.840
you will come and save him, right?

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:47.020
That's a huge tree.

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:50.090
That is the World Tree which supports the Digital World.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.840
Is Yggdrasil over there?

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:53.750
Yes.

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:57.600
No one has ever seen what Yggdrasil really looks like,

00:07:57.820 --> 00:08:01.480
but it's quite likely that he's predicted this unprecedented crisis.

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:04.560
I've heard that he has finally made an appearance.

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:07.690
My dad must've climbed that tree...

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:10.800
Now, let us take this path ahead.

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:11.920
No, you shall not.

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:14.200
What's that?!

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:21.780
That's...

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:23.750
That's Craniummon!

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:26.840
He is one of the Royal Knights who protect Yggdrasil!

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:28.340
The Royal Knights?

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:33.240
I, Craniummon, shall eliminate all who dare to approach Yggdrasil.

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:34.300
What?

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:37.710
We just came here to see Yggdrasil.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:38.800
At least let us talk to him!

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.080
Aniki!

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.060
I believe I told you not to come closer.

00:08:46.060 --> 00:08:48.060
The next time you do, I will slice out your heart.

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:49.670
What was that?

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:52.030
Craniummon didn't even move!

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:53.810
No, that's not it!

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:57.490
He attacked at a speed that didn't leave behind an afterimage!

00:08:58.320 --> 00:09:00.500
You'll slice my heart out, eh?

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:01.690
Bring it on!

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:03.530
I'll force you to let us pass!

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:04.040
Aniki!

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:05.990
It's futile.

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:08.670
Aniki!

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:17.280
His Digisoul!

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:19.890
You were able to see Craniummon's attack?

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:21.860
No way.

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:25.100
I just punched the air in front of where my heart was!

00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:29.170
You intend to fight to the bitter end to pass through here?

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.190
Of course!

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:32.080
Let's go, Agumon!

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:32.770
Okay!

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:38.180
Digisoul Charge!

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:39.350
Overdrive!

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:41.910
Agumon, evolve!

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:55.300
ShineGreymon!

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:57.290
All right! Let's join them!

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:58.250
Yes!

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:03.490
Digisoul Charge!

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:03.490
Digisoul Charge!

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:04.770
Overdrive!

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:04.770
Overdrive!

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.180
Lalamon, evolve!

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:08.490
Gaomon, evolve!

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:10.000
Falcomon, evolve!

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:23.240
Rosemon!

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:36.250
MirageGaogamon!

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:46.260
Ravemon!

00:10:58.950 --> 00:10:59.940
That was...!

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:01.310
You!

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:04.660
You were the one who crushed me flat!

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:06.630
I-It was an accident! An accident!

00:11:06.630 --> 00:11:08.370
She's right! We didn't do it on purpose!

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.590
No! That was unforgivable!

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:11.670
I won't forgive you for it!

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:12.460
Gotsumon!

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:16.560
We came all this way trusting your word!

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:19.050
That's why you should believe us, too!

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:20.780
That's what a man does!

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:28.930
Okay.

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:32.100
It looks like we were able to convince him in a really confusing way!

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:35.170
Even with my intelligence, I can't tell how that happened!

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:40.860
Look out!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.530
ShineGreymon!

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:47.620
You bastard!

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:50.370
Gotsumon just brought us here!

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:52.780
My duty...

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:55.830
is to get rid of all who dare to approach Yggdrasil.

00:11:55.830 --> 00:11:58.340
Those who assist you must also be eliminated.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.030
What an unbelievable guy.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.550
That's uncalled for.

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:02.740
Damn it!

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:04.400
ShineGreymon, go and...!

00:12:04.400 --> 00:12:06.710
Go and beat him up!

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:08.250
Now go!

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:09.220
Do it!

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:17.200
Double Crescent Mirage!

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:21.530
Thorn Whip!

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:32.500
Are you simply all talk?

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:35.210
Impossible.

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:38.710
They can't even touch Craniummon!

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:40.580
Don't give up!

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:44.450
We defeated Belphemon, so we can't lose to a guy like him!

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:47.530
GeoGrey Sword!

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:59.860
Rise, my demonic spear, Claíomh Solais!

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:07.950
What?

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:09.370
Craniummon has a weapon, too!

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:16.650
We Royal Knights, who protect Yggdrasil,

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.980
are the ones who are closest to God!

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:22.590
Opposing the likes of us...

00:13:22.590 --> 00:13:26.760
is the same foolish act as challenging divine authority!

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:34.020
Through pain, you shall taste first-hand

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:36.020
the extent of your foolishness!

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:39.310
End Waltz!

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:53.570
Rosemon!

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:56.770
He's too strong!

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:59.580
This is the true power of a Royal Knight...

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:01.260
Now do you understand?

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:05.380
Come, my next attack shall sever you from any lingering attachments you have to this world!

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:29.490
H-He stopped Craniummon's spear!

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:32.880
You...

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:35.160
What's this crap about the Royal Knights?!

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:36.630
What's this crap about God?!

00:14:36.630 --> 00:14:41.500
Two worlds are about to be destroyed, and just what the hell is your God doing?!

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:42.500
What?

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:45.150
Someone who doesn't even bother to save the world...

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:46.490
shouldn't...

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:49.380
shouldn't call himself a god!

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:54.350
W-What?

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:07.190
Cr-Craniummon...

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:08.610
Got knocked down!

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:10.190
Aniki, that's amazing!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:12.890
C'mon!

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:14.620
Show 'im what you've got!

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:21.930
Charge!

00:15:24.810 --> 00:15:27.910
Digisoul Burst!

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:46.240
ShineGreymon!

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:47.790
Burst Mode!

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:49.590
This light is...

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:51.370
Burst Mode!

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:54.660
Masaru is showing full control over the power surpassing Ultimate Level!

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.820
Go, ShineGreymon!

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:04.580
All right, finish him in one shot!

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:07.670
What?

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:12.170
That was pathetic, Craniummon.

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:16.340
How could you allow yourself to be pushed around like this?

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:21.520
Th-That's...

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.150
Dukemon!

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:31.410
Magnamon!

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:32.650
Dynasmon!

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:34.650
RhodoKnightmon!

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:36.110
UlforceV-Dramon!

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:37.620
And...

00:16:38.570 --> 00:16:40.010
Omegamon!

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:50.550
Royal Knights

00:16:41.470 --> 00:16:42.560
Royal Knights.

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:47.470
They are the Digimon, known as guardian dieties, who hold the highest rank of network security in the Digital World.

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:50.550
Each of them fight for their own personal justice.

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:52.960
There are so many Royal Knights!

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:55.010
Who are they?

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:56.600
Interesting!

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:59.430
Let's take them all on, ShineGreymon!

00:16:59.430 --> 00:17:00.240
Okay!

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:02.470
Royal Saber!

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:04.680
What's that?

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:13.790
No! I wanna take him with me!

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:14.730
Masaru.

00:17:15.310 --> 00:17:18.160
That frog has a family, too.

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:19.280
A family?

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:20.710
Yeah.

00:17:20.710 --> 00:17:24.180
The mommy frog has dinner made and is waiting for him to come back.

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:25.360
Oh.

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:28.000
Then I guess I should let the poor guy go home!

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:30.670
See ya!

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:32.330
You did great.

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:33.700
That's what a man should do!

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:37.130
Now, let's go home, too.

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:39.050
Masaru.

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:40.980
Dad...

00:17:45.150 --> 00:17:46.140
You guys...

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.040
Damn it...

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:57.200
They're planning to finish us off...

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:58.930
I won't...

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:00.200
let that happen...

00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:02.530
This fight...

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:04.160
isn't over yet...

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:20.780
Dad...

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:23.180
Is that you, Dad...?

00:18:23.590 --> 00:18:24.100
What?

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:25.720
That's Masaru's father?

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:28.150
Don't scare me like that.

00:18:28.150 --> 00:18:32.270
Why didn't you contact us or something if you were safe?

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:34.920
C'mon, let's go home.

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.610
Mom and Chika are waiting.

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:44.950
Dad...?

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:46.900
Insolent fellow!

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:48.910
Do you have any idea who you are speaking to?

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:51.400
Who I'm speaking to...? This is my...

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:55.640
This person is our God, Yggdrasil!

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:01.570
Dad is... the Digital World's God...?

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.220
No way!

00:19:05.780 --> 00:19:08.870
Masaru's father is Yggdrasil...?

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:11.220
I-I don't get it, Dad.

00:19:11.220 --> 00:19:15.440
We came here because we were told to go see Yggdrasil.

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:18.110
Explain to me what's going on here...

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:21.550
There is nothing left to tell you.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:24.860
Yggdrasil has already finished discussing this matter.

00:19:24.860 --> 00:19:27.330
In order to save the Digital World...

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:30.540
the human world will be annihilated.

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:33.120
Annihilated?

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:36.620
H-He's lying, right?

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:38.850
You can't destroy the human world...

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:41.320
My dad would never say that...

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:43.510
The ones who destroyed the dimensional barrier

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:48.570
and who are leading the two worlds to their destruction are none other than the humans.

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:51.020
There is no worth in keeping the humans alive.

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:51.770
Da...

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:54.480
Dad...

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:56.180
The human world...

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:58.440
will be destroyed.

00:19:59.160 --> 00:19:59.940
Masaru.

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:07.680
It broke!

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:25.360
Yggdrasil.

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:27.800
What shall be done with them?

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:30.270
They are of no use in the Digital World.

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:31.520
Kill them.

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:38.030
Is this the end for us?

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:40.020
N-No!

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:41.270
It's over!

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:42.150
Damn it!

00:20:42.530 --> 00:20:43.400
Aniki!

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:44.920
Get a hold of yourself!

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:46.110
Aniki!

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:47.640
Farewell.

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:53.450
Sleipmon!

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.300
There's another big one!

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:02.130
Oh no!

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:03.980
Plasma Shoot!

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:08.930
You can't escape.

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:10.670
Final Elysian!

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:16.650
Did you get him?

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:17.370
No.

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:19.290
He won't die from that.

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:20.700
Then we should pursue him!

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:22.360
That won't be necessary.

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:23.500
But...

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:26.400
No matter what the case, everything will be wiped out.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:31.030
They won't have any place left to call home.

